WEBVTT

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:14.720
-Morning, Arthur.
-Morning, Bob.

00:00:17.348 --> 00:00:18.933
Interdepartmental memos.

00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:21.830
We used to use owls.
Mess was unbelievable.

00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:30.652
Merlin's beard. Thank you, Kingsley.

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:34.057
-They changed the time of your hearing.
-When is it?

00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:36.971
In five minutes.

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:47.307
Department of Mysteries.

00:00:50.881 --> 00:00:55.010
And I'm confident, minister,
that you will do the right thing.

00:00:55.177 --> 00:00:57.304
Yes, but we must be--

00:01:04.436 --> 00:01:07.146
Remember, during the hearing,
speak only when you're spoken to.

00:01:08.023 --> 00:01:10.478
Keep calm. You've done nothing wrong.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.055
As the Muggles say, truth will out.

00:01:15.656 --> 00:01:17.283
-Yes?
-Mm.

00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:20.494
I'm not allowed in, I'm afraid.

00:01:22.121 --> 00:01:23.342
Good luck, Harry.

00:01:27.835 --> 00:01:30.337
Disciplinary hearing
of the 12th of August...

00:01:30.504 --> 00:01:33.465
...into offenses committed
by Harry James Potter...

00:01:33.632 --> 00:01:37.261
...resident at Number 4 Privet Drive,
Little Whinging, Surrey.

00:01:37.428 --> 00:01:40.514
Interrogators: Cornelius Oswald Fudge,
Minister of Mag--

00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:42.186
Witness for the defense.

00:01:42.683 --> 00:01:45.223
Albus Percival Wulfric...

00:01:46.186 --> 00:01:48.686
...Brian Dumbledore.

00:01:49.898 --> 00:01:53.193
You got our message
that the time and place of the hearing...

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.904
-...had been changed, did you?
-I must have missed it.

00:01:56.071 --> 00:01:57.531
But by a happy mistake,

00:01:57.698 --> 00:02:00.034
I arrived at the Ministry
three hours early.

00:02:02.995 --> 00:02:04.014
The charges?

00:02:04.161 --> 00:02:06.874
The charges against the accused
are as follows:

00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:08.709
"That he did knowingly...

00:02:08.876 --> 00:02:12.421
...and in full awareness
of the illegality of his actions...

00:02:12.588 --> 00:02:15.591
...produce a Patronus Charm...

00:02:15.758 --> 00:02:17.751
...in the presence of a Muggle."

00:02:19.178 --> 00:02:22.473
-Do you deny producing said Patronus?
-No, but--

00:02:22.639 --> 00:02:26.101
And you were aware that you were
forbidden to use magic outside school...

00:02:26.268 --> 00:02:29.146
-...while under the age of 17?
-Yes, I was, but--

00:02:29.313 --> 00:02:32.391
Witches and wizards of the Wizengamot--

00:02:32.568 --> 00:02:34.459
I was only doing it
because of the Dementors.

00:02:37.821 --> 00:02:39.438
Dementors?

00:02:40.074 --> 00:02:41.742
In Little Whinging?

00:02:41.909 --> 00:02:44.244
That's quite clever.

00:02:44.411 --> 00:02:47.111
Muggles can't see Dementors,
can they, boy?

00:02:47.831 --> 00:02:49.958
-Highly convenient.
-I'm not lying.

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:51.721
-There were two of them, and if I hadn't--
-Enough.

00:02:52.878 --> 00:02:56.641
I'm sorry to interrupt what I'm sure would
have been a very well-rehearsed story...

00:02:57.257 --> 00:03:01.762
...but since you can produce
no witnesses of the event--

00:03:01.929 --> 00:03:05.567
Pardon me, minister,
but as it happens, we can.

00:03:09.853 --> 00:03:12.130
Please describe the attack.

00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:16.848
What did they look like?

00:03:18.112 --> 00:03:23.074
Well, one of them was very large
and the other rather skinny.

00:03:24.618 --> 00:03:27.454
Not the boys. The Dementors.

00:03:27.621 --> 00:03:30.681
Oh, right, right. Well, um, big.

00:03:32.459 --> 00:03:36.439
Cloaked. Then everything went cold...

00:03:37.714 --> 00:03:40.645
...as though all the happiness
had gone from the world.

00:03:41.301 --> 00:03:46.390
Now, look here. Dementors don't just
wander into a Muggle suburb...

00:03:46.557 --> 00:03:50.185
...and happen across a wizard.
The odds are astronomical.

00:03:50.352 --> 00:03:52.104
I don't think anyone would believe...

00:03:52.271 --> 00:03:54.288
...the Dementors were there
by coincidence, minister.

00:03:57.818 --> 00:04:00.256
I'm sure I must have misunderstood you,
professor.

00:04:00.863 --> 00:04:05.528
Dementors are, after all, under
the control of the Ministry of Magic.

00:04:06.535 --> 00:04:09.827
And it's so silly of me,
but it sounded for a moment as though...

00:04:10.914 --> 00:04:14.918
...you were suggesting that the Ministry
had ordered the attack on this boy.

00:04:15.085 --> 00:04:17.758
That would be disturbing
indeed, Madam Undersecretary...

00:04:18.185 --> 00:04:21.907
...which is why I'm sure the Ministry
will be mounting a full-scale inquiry...

00:04:22.384 --> 00:04:25.392
...into why the two Dementors
were so very far from Azkaban...

00:04:25.929 --> 00:04:28.508
...and why they mounted an attack
without authorization.

00:04:30.184 --> 00:04:31.344
Of course, there is someone...

00:04:32.728 --> 00:04:34.235
...who might be behind the attack.

00:04:38.358 --> 00:04:41.648
Cornelius, I implore you to see reason.

00:04:43.155 --> 00:04:47.011
The evidence that the Dark Lord
has returned is incontrovertible.

00:04:47.868 --> 00:04:49.882
He is not back.

00:04:56.143 --> 00:04:57.954
In the matter of Harry Potter...

00:04:59.338 --> 00:05:00.977
...the law clearly states...

00:05:02.007 --> 00:05:06.386
...that magic may be used before Muggles
in life-threatening situations.

00:05:06.553 --> 00:05:09.473
Laws can be changed if necessary,
Dumbledore.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.809
Clearly. Has it become practice
to hold a full criminal trial...

00:05:12.976 --> 00:05:15.854
...to deal with a simple matter
of underage magic?

00:05:24.238 --> 00:05:26.874
Those in favor of conviction?

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:41.588
Those in favor
of clearing the accused of all charges?

00:05:55.686 --> 00:05:57.078
Cleared of all charges.

00:06:00.983 --> 00:06:02.354
Professor.

00:06:15.664 --> 00:06:18.270
Padfoot. Are you barking mad?

00:06:18.917 --> 00:06:20.415
You'll blow the entire operation.

00:06:29.678 --> 00:06:32.306
Sirius, what are you doing here?
If somebody sees you....

00:06:32.472 --> 00:06:34.010
I had to see you off, didn't I?

00:06:36.893 --> 00:06:38.436
What's life without a little risk?

00:06:39.905 --> 00:06:41.940
I don't wanna see you
get chucked back in Azkaban.

00:06:42.107 --> 00:06:43.567
Oh, don't worry about me.

00:06:43.984 --> 00:06:47.959
Anyway, I wanted you to have this.

00:06:54.369 --> 00:06:56.364
Original Order of the Phoenix.

00:06:57.956 --> 00:06:59.026
Marlene McKinnon.

00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:01.869
She was killed
two weeks after this was taken.

00:07:02.794 --> 00:07:04.794
Voldemort wiped out her entire family.

00:07:06.381 --> 00:07:08.175
Frank and Alice Longbottom.

00:07:08.342 --> 00:07:09.733
Neville's parents.

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:12.320
They suffered a fate worse than death,
you ask me.

00:07:15.641 --> 00:07:17.181
It's been 14 years.

00:07:18.935 --> 00:07:21.768
And still a day doesn't go by
I don't miss your dad.

00:07:27.819 --> 00:07:29.739
Do you really think
there's going to be a war, Sirius?

00:07:33.158 --> 00:07:35.343
It feels like it did before.

00:07:40.415 --> 00:07:42.209
You keep it.

00:07:42.709 --> 00:07:46.079
Anyway, I suppose
you're the young ones now.

00:07:49.299 --> 00:07:50.734
I'll see you at the train.

00:07:51.301 --> 00:07:52.725
Bye-bye, darling.

00:07:54.221 --> 00:07:55.722
I love you.

00:07:56.333 --> 00:07:57.705
Hold my hand, lovey.

00:07:58.725 --> 00:08:01.019
There they are.
They're in the far carriage.

00:08:01.186 --> 00:08:02.479
Bye.

